      "math_academy_id": "q-81792",
      "problem": "In $△LMN,$ we have $m∠N={36}^{∘},$ $MN=9,$ and $LM=6.$ Which of the following statements *could* be true?\n\nI. $∠L$ is acute\n\nII. $m∠L={75.02}^{∘}$ rounded to $2$ decimal places\n\nIII. $m∠L={61.85}^{∘}$ rounded to $2$ decimal places",
